// AgentCore conformance -- example-policies-temporal.md, "Require a successful prerequisite,
// recently". The first statement is AWS's, verbatim. The second is OURS, as in the previous example.
// Expected decisions: the table, with timings of our choosing, plus AWS's "attempted versus
// succeeded" contrast with the previous example as a row.

permit (
    principal,
    action == AgentCore::Action::"InsuranceAPI___approve_claim",
    resource == AgentCore::Gateway::"arn:aws:bedrock-agentcore:us-west-2:123456789012:gateway/insurance-gw-a1b2c3d4e5"
)
when temporal {
    formerly within 5m AgentCore::Action::"InsuranceAPI___get_claim_status"::response{
        eventResource: resource
    }
};

// ours
permit (
    principal,
    action == AgentCore::Action::"InsuranceAPI___get_claim_status",
    resource == AgentCore::Gateway::"arn:aws:bedrock-agentcore:us-west-2:123456789012:gateway/insurance-gw-a1b2c3d4e5"
);

//| target InsuranceAPI
//|
//| row aws-table: approve_claim before any completed lookup
//| @0  request  approve_claim     { claimId: "CLM-1", approved: true, approvedAmountCents: 100000 }  DENY
//|
//| row aws-table: lookup completes, then approve_claim within the window
//| @0  request  get_claim_status  { claimId: "CLM-1" }  ALLOW aws-prose
//| @1  response get_claim_status  { claimId: "CLM-1" } -> { claimId: "CLM-1", status: "OPEN" }
//| @60 request  approve_claim     { claimId: "CLM-1", approved: true, approvedAmountCents: 100000 }  ALLOW
//|
//| row aws-table: approve_claim after the window elapses
//| @0   request  get_claim_status { claimId: "CLM-1" }  ALLOW aws-prose
//| @1   response get_claim_status { claimId: "CLM-1" } -> { claimId: "CLM-1", status: "OPEN" }
//| @400 request  approve_claim    { claimId: "CLM-1", approved: true, approvedAmountCents: 100000 }  DENY
//|
//| row aws-prose: the lookup was attempted and the tool FAILED -- not a success, so no permission
//| @0  request  get_claim_status  { claimId: "CLM-1" }  ALLOW
//| @1  error    get_claim_status  { claimId: "CLM-1" }
//| @10 request  approve_claim     { claimId: "CLM-1", approved: true, approvedAmountCents: 100000 }  DENY
